<div class="da-main">
<div class="da-hero">

<h1 class="da-h1" style="font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 52px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin: 0 0 18px; color: #0D0D2B">The No-Stock Blueprint: How Smart Lebanese Are Selling Online Without Ever Owning a Single Product</h1>
<div style="color: #001EFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 14px">Thursday, October 29 · 8:00 PM Beirut time · Live on Zoom</div>
<p class="da-lede" style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; color: #44506A; margin: 0 0 28px">Join Majd LIVE for a free training where he breaks down the exact system 800+ Droparabia users are running right now: which products to sell, how they reach the customer, and how you get paid. All without putting your money into stock.</p>

<div id="video" style="position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 3px solid #001EFF; background: #0D0D2B; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 20px">
<video id="vsl" class="vsl-video" poster="/vsl-main-poster.jpg" muted autoplay playsinline preload="metadata" src="/vsl-main.mp4"></video>
