<div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #DDE3F5; border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px 32px; margin-bottom: 48px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,30,255,0.06)">
<h2 style="font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #0D0D2B">Everyone tells you to start an online store. Nobody tells you how to start without risking your savings.</h2>
<p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #44506A; margin: 0 0 14px">You've watched the YouTube videos. You've saved the TikToks. You still don't know which products actually sell in Lebanon, who delivers them, or how the cash on delivery reaches you. And buying stock you're not sure you can sell? That's how most people lose their first $1,000.</p>
<p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: #0D0D2B; font-weight: 700; margin: 0">This isn't a "you" problem. It's an infrastructure problem. And it's already solved.</p>
</div>

<a href="#register" class="da-mcta">Save My Free Seat <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19V5"></path><path d="M6 11l6-6 6 6"></path></svg></a>
<h2 style="font-family: 'IBrand', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 30px; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #0D0D2B">What You'll Learn:</h2>
<p style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #44506A; margin: 0 0 22px">In this free live training, Majd breaks down the Droparabia E-Commerce Infrastructure System, the same setup 800+ users are running right now.</p>
