<div class="da-lesson">
<div class="da-lesson-num">01</div>
<div class="da-lesson-ttl">How to launch your store without buying inventory</div>
<div class="da-lesson-body">So your money goes into marketing, not boxes sitting in your room.</div>
</div>
<div class="da-lesson">
<div class="da-lesson-num">02</div>
<div class="da-lesson-ttl">How to pick products that already sell in the Lebanese market</div>
<div class="da-lesson-body">Instead of guessing and testing random items for months.</div>
</div>
<div class="da-lesson">
<div class="da-lesson-num">03</div>
<div class="da-lesson-ttl">How orders get packed, delivered and paid for without you touching them</div>
<div class="da-lesson-body">From sourcing to the customer's doorstep to cash in your account.</div>
</div>
<div class="da-lesson">
<div class="da-lesson-num">04</div>
<div class="da-lesson-ttl">The one skill that actually decides your income</div>
<div class="da-lesson-body">And why it's marketing, not suppliers, logistics or a fancy website.</div>
</div>
<div class="da-lesson">
<div class="da-lesson-num">05</div>
<div class="da-lesson-ttl">The first 30 days, step by step</div>
<div class="da-lesson-body">Exactly what to do each week if you're starting from zero next to your job or studies.</div>
</div>
</div>

<a href="#register" class="da-mcta">Save My Free Seat <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19V5"></path><path d="M6 11l6-6 6 6"></path></svg></a>
